# tests/core/du.cases: ARGS | STDIN | DIFF (docs/specs/2026-11-06-c-core.md section 6). Blocks depend on the host's
# file system (H). The oracle lists a directory in its own order, the native du by name, so the cases name trees
# with one entry a directory, or -s.
look | - | H
 | - | D-4 H
-a look/sub/inner | - | H
-s look | - | H
-k look | - | H
-sk look . | - | H
-s look/a.txt look/sub/c.txt look | - | H
-a look/a.txt | - | H
-x look | - | H
-H look | - | H
-L look | - | H
missing look | - | H
deep | - | D-12
-as look | - | D-3
-h look | - | D-1
-d 1 look | - | D-1
-a look | - | D-4 H
-a | - | D-4 H
